    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you wade through the dark halls of House Haywood, you will find meaning in blood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Charles Dalton, a forensics analyst who specializes in blood spatter, tasked with using his expert skill set to solve the disappearances of multiple persons in the snowy region of Haywood. In the darkness of a Tudor mansion, you hear the foghorn blow. You are not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.poster.avif?t=1753526277\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.webm?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.mp4?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on the real-life practices of forensic analysts, we have created mechanics that allow the player to understand and uncover the truth behind the evidence they find. Throughout She's Leaving, you begin to discover that there has always been a target on your back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a taser, the choice is up to you \u2013 are you going to run and hide, or stand and fight? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/dbf69fb3f73775658fb05b330d0f0232.poster.avif?t=1753526277\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/dbf69fb3f73775658fb05b330d0f0232.webm?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/dbf69fb3f73775658fb05b330d0f0232.mp4?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ENVIRONMENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the dimly lit halls of an ancient home to the haze-covered docks of Haywood itself, journey through handcrafted environments to look for evidence that will help you in your journey. Be sure to search every nook and cranny, as there is a story to be told in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.poster.avif?t=1753526277\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.webm?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.mp4?t=1753526277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMurder is seldom senseless, it's targetted.\u201d </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Charles Dalton</strong></p>",
